            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/my_12.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_02_my_12\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 02</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">事物的永恒发展与过程性</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_02\" id=\"audio_btn_my_12\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"4.094\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_12_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">辩证法的第二个总特征，是事物的永恒发展。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"7.78\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"4.094\" id=\"sent_my_12_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">发展与一般的运动变化有什么根本区别。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"12.653\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"7.781\" id=\"sent_my_12_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">运动包括一切变化，而发展是前进的，上升的运动。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"17.117\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"12.653\" id=\"sent_my_12_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">发展的实质，是新事物的产生和旧事物的灭亡。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"20.0\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"17.117\" id=\"sent_my_12_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">为什么新事物必然战胜旧事物？</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"27.168\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"20.0\" id=\"sent_my_12_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，新事物符合历史发展的必然趋势，具有强大的生命力和远大的发展前途。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"34.349\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"27.168\" id=\"sent_my_12_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，新事物否定了旧事物中消极腐朽的东西，吸收并发展了旧事物中合理的因素。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"36.313\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"34.349\" id=\"sent_my_12_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">并增添了新内容。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"42.972\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"36.314\" id=\"sent_my_12_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，在社会历史领域，新事物符合最广大人民群众的根本利益和要求。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"45.472\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"42.972\" id=\"sent_my_12_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">因而必然得到人民的拥护。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"49.094\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"45.472\" id=\"sent_my_12_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">唯物辩证法由此推导出了过程论思想。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"54.77\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"49.094\" id=\"sent_my_12_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">恩格斯指出，世界不是既成事物的集合体，而是过程的集合体。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"58.762\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"54.77\" id=\"sent_my_12_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">任何事物都有其产生，发展和灭亡的历程。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"60.332\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"58.763\" id=\"sent_my_12_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场避坑。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"67.219\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"60.332\" id=\"sent_my_12_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">新事物的标准绝不是出现时间的先后，也不是形式的新奇或力量的暂时强大。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"71.071\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"67.219\" id=\"sent_my_12_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">唯一的标准在于是否符合历史必然规律。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_12\" data-end=\"77.946\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_12_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"71.071\" id=\"sent_my_12_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">前进上升方为展，新迎旧破不可挡，历史必然符民意，过程集合万象长。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
