            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/my_15.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_02_my_15\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 05</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">矛盾的普遍性与特殊性辩证关系及精髓</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_02\" id=\"audio_btn_my_15\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"5.599\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_15_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">矛盾不仅有属性，在分布和形态上还表现为普遍性与特殊性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"9.668\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"5.599\" id=\"sent_my_15_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">矛盾普遍性是指矛盾无处不在，无时不有。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"15.841\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"9.668\" id=\"sent_my_15_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">方法论要求我们敢于承认矛盾，直面矛盾，运用一分为二的观点看问题。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"22.551\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"15.842\" id=\"sent_my_15_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">矛盾特殊性是指不同事物的矛盾，同一事物在不同阶段的矛盾各不相同。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"28.724\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"22.551\" id=\"sent_my_15_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">方法论要求我们必须做到具体问题具体分析，这是马克思主义活的灵魂。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"31.441\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"28.724\" id=\"sent_my_15_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">两者的辩证关系是怎样的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"37.449\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"31.441\" id=\"sent_my_15_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">矛盾的普遍性即绝对性，共性，矛盾的特殊性即相对性，个性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"41.824\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"37.449\" id=\"sent_my_15_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">共性寓于个性之中，没有离开个性的抽象共性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"46.582\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"41.824\" id=\"sent_my_15_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">个性也离不开共性，任何个性都包含着某种共性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"53.954\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"46.582\" id=\"sent_my_15_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">两者的辩证关系，正是马克思主义普遍真理同中国具体实际相结合的哲学基础。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"57.933\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"53.954\" id=\"sent_my_15_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">也就是马克思主义中国化时代化的哲学底座。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"60.038\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"57.933\" id=\"sent_my_15_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场选择题陷阱。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"67.627\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"60.038\" id=\"sent_my_15_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">切忌颠倒共性与个性的关系，个性绝不包含在共性之中，而是共性寓于个性之中。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_15\" data-end=\"74.337\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_15_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"67.628\" id=\"sent_my_15_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">时时处处皆矛盾，具体分析是灵魂，共性寓于个性内，中国化路哲学根。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
