            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/my_16.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_02_my_16\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 06</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">两点论和重点论的辩证统一</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_02\" id=\"audio_btn_my_16\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"6.390\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_16_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在复杂事物的发展过程中，往往存在多个矛盾，矛盾内部也有不同方面。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"12.398\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"6.39\" id=\"sent_my_16_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这就推导出了主要矛盾，次要矛盾，以及矛盾的主要方面与次要方面。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"18.265\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"12.398\" id=\"sent_my_16_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">主要矛盾在事物发展中居于支配地位，对发展过程起决定作用。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"25.612\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"18.265\" id=\"sent_my_16_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">矛盾的主要方面支配着事物的性质，事物的性质主要由主要矛盾的主要方面所规定。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"28.788\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"25.612\" id=\"sent_my_16_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">两点论和重点论是怎样统一的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"33.699\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"28.788\" id=\"sent_my_16_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">两点论要求我们在看问题时既看主要矛盾又看次要矛盾。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"38.15\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"33.699\" id=\"sent_my_16_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">既看矛盾主要方面又看次要方面，反对一点论。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"45.166\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"38.15\" id=\"sent_my_16_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">重点论要求我们在看到全面的同时，必须准确把握主要矛盾和矛盾的主要方面。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"46.747\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"45.166\" id=\"sent_my_16_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">反对均衡论。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"51.9\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"46.747\" id=\"sent_my_16_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">两点论是有重点的两点论，重点论是看到两点的重点论。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"53.839\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"51.901\" id=\"sent_my_16_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场大题直通。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"60.944\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"53.839\" id=\"sent_my_16_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">材料讲高质量发展是首要任务，抓住主要矛盾，牵住牛鼻子，用主要矛盾原理。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"67.449\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"60.944\" id=\"sent_my_16_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">材料讲辨别主流与支流，看人看成绩看大节，用矛盾主要方面原理。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_16\" data-end=\"74.439\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_16_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"67.449\" id=\"sent_my_16_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">抓牛鼻子主矛盾，定性评判看主方，两点全面防片面，重点鲜明不彷徨。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
