            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/my_17.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_02_my_17\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 07</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">量变质变规律与适度原则</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_02\" id=\"audio_btn_my_17\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"4.158\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_17_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">辩证法三大规律的第二条，是质量互变规律。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"7.385\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"4.158\" id=\"sent_my_17_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">事物是怎样由浅入深发生变化的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"13.967\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"7.385\" id=\"sent_my_17_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">质是一事物区别于其他事物的内在规定性，事物的质是通过属性表现出来的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"19.247\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"13.967\" id=\"sent_my_17_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">量是事物的规模，程度，速度等可以用数量表示的规定性。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"25.14\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"19.247\" id=\"sent_my_17_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">度是质和量的统一，是事物保持其质的量的限度，幅度与范围。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"27.755\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"25.14\" id=\"sent_my_17_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">度两端的极限叫关节点。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"33.712\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"27.755\" id=\"sent_my_17_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">量变是事物数量的增减和空间排列的变动，是连续的，渐进的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"38.24\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"33.712\" id=\"sent_my_17_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">质变是事物根本性质的飞跃，是渐进过程的中断。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"40.893\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"38.24\" id=\"sent_my_17_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">量变与质变的辩证关系。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"47.959\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"40.893\" id=\"sent_my_17_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">量变是质变的必要准备，质变是量变的必然结果，质变又为新的量变开辟道路。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"49.566\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"47.959\" id=\"sent_my_17_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">方法论要求。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"56.211\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"49.566\" id=\"sent_my_17_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">既要重视量的积累，不积跬步无以至千里，又要在适当时机果断促成飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"60.281\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"56.212\" id=\"sent_my_17_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">同时要坚持适度原则，防止过犹不及。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"66.773\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"60.281\" id=\"sent_my_17_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">防微杜渐，过犹不及，底线思维，全都是适度原则在考场的生动体现。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_17\" data-end=\"73.648\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_17_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"66.773\" id=\"sent_my_17_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">度为界限持本质，微小积累促飞跃，过犹不及守底线，量质互变展新图。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
