            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_02_my_19\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 09</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">辩证法五对基本范畴（上）：原因与结果、必然与偶然、现实与可能</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_02\" id=\"audio_btn_my_19\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"4.158\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_19_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">唯物辩证法不仅有三大规律，还有五对范畴。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"6.224\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"4.158\" id=\"sent_my_19_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">我们首先看前三对。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"10.051\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"6.224\" id=\"sent_my_19_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">原因与结果，必然与偶然，现实与可能。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"12.258\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"10.051\" id=\"sent_my_19_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一对是原因与结果。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"17.015\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"12.258\" id=\"sent_my_19_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">引起某种现象的现象是原因，被引起的现象是结果。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"22.538\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"17.015\" id=\"sent_my_19_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">因果联系具有先后顺序，但前后相继不一定都是因果联系。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"26.033\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"22.538\" id=\"sent_my_19_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">必须具有引起与被引起的必然关系。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"28.431\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"26.033\" id=\"sent_my_19_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二对是必然与偶然。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"33.469\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"28.431\" id=\"sent_my_19_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">必然是事物联系和发展中一定要发生的，不可避免的趋势。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"37.793\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"33.469\" id=\"sent_my_19_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">偶然是不确定的，可能发生也可能不发生的趋势。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"43.558\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"37.793\" id=\"sent_my_19_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">必然存在于偶然之中，通过大量偶然表现出来并为自己开辟道路。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"46.033\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"43.558\" id=\"sent_my_19_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">偶然背后隐藏着必然。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"48.495\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"46.033\" id=\"sent_my_19_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三对是现实与可能。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"52.181\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"48.495\" id=\"sent_my_19_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">现实是当前已经实现出来的客观存在。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"56.556\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"52.181\" id=\"sent_my_19_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">可能是包含在现实中预示事物前途的种种趋势。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"63.112\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"56.556\" id=\"sent_my_19_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">可能分为现实可能与抽象可能，抽象可能缺乏充分根据，当前无法实现。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"64.834\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"63.112\" id=\"sent_my_19_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场避坑点。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"69.783\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_17\" data-sent-idx=\"17\" data-start=\"64.834\" id=\"sent_my_19_17\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">守株待兔之所以错误，在于把偶然联系当成了必然联系。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_19\" data-end=\"76.62\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_19_18\" data-sent-idx=\"18\" data-start=\"69.783\" id=\"sent_my_19_18\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">前后相继莫妄断，偶然深处必然藏，立足现实谋可能，脚踏实地步步强。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
