            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_03_my_24\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 04</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">认识运动的两次飞跃及其辩证过程</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_03\" id=\"audio_btn_my_24\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"5.893\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_24_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">认识的运动是一个充满生机的辩证发展过程，包含两次历史性飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"7.283\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"5.893\" id=\"sent_my_24_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一次飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"9.694\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"7.283\" id=\"sent_my_24_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">从感性认识到理性认识。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"15.931\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"9.694\" id=\"sent_my_24_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">感性认识是对事物表面现象的反映，包括感觉，知觉和表象三种形式。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"18.635\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"15.931\" id=\"sent_my_24_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">特点是直接性和具体性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"24.974\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"18.635\" id=\"sent_my_24_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">理性认识是对事物内部本质的反映，包括概念，判断和推理三种形式。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"27.882\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"24.974\" id=\"sent_my_24_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">特点是间接性和抽象性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"31.135\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"27.883\" id=\"sent_my_24_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">实现第一次飞跃必须具备两个条件。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"35.791\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"31.135\" id=\"sent_my_24_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，占有十分丰富而且合乎实际的感性材料。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"42.398\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"35.791\" id=\"sent_my_24_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，运用科学的思维方法对材料进行去粗取精，去伪存真，由此及彼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"44.707\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"42.398\" id=\"sent_my_24_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">由表及里的加工制作。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"46.186\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"44.707\" id=\"sent_my_24_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二次飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"48.992\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"46.186\" id=\"sent_my_24_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">从理性认识到实践的飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"53.66\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"48.992\" id=\"sent_my_24_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这是认识过程中更为重要，意义更为重大的一次飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"59.311\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"53.661\" id=\"sent_my_24_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">因为理性认识只有回到实践中，才能转化为改造世界的物质力量。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"63.826\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"59.311\" id=\"sent_my_24_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">也只有回到实践中，真理性才能得到检验和发展。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_24\" data-end=\"70.613\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_24_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"63.827\" id=\"sent_my_24_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">感性直接表象显，概念推理升理智，加工制作飞跃起，回到实践建奇功。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
