            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/my_37.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_05_my_37\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 02</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">生产商品的劳动二重性：具体劳动与抽象劳动</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_05\" id=\"audio_btn_my_37\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"4.094\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_37_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">商品为什么会具有使用价值和价值这二因素呢？</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"6.849\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"4.094\" id=\"sent_my_37_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">马克思给出了划时代的解答。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"10.408\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"6.849\" id=\"sent_my_37_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这是由生产商品的劳动二重性决定的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"14.362\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"10.408\" id=\"sent_my_37_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">劳动二重性是指具体劳动和抽象劳动。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"21.492\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"14.362\" id=\"sent_my_37_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">具体劳动是在具体的特定形式下进行的劳动，比如木匠做桌子，裁缝做衣服。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"26.428\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"21.492\" id=\"sent_my_37_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">具体劳动创造商品的使用价值，体现人与自然的关系。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"32.143\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"26.429\" id=\"sent_my_37_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">抽象劳动是撇开具体形式的无差别的一般人类脑力和体力消耗。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"37.615\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"32.143\" id=\"sent_my_37_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">抽象劳动形成商品的价值，体现人与人之间的社会生产关系。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"43.202\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"37.615\" id=\"sent_my_37_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">具体劳动和抽象劳动不是两次劳动，也不是两种独立的劳动。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"46.556\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"43.202\" id=\"sent_my_37_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">而是同一劳动过程的两个不同方面。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"51.441\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"46.556\" id=\"sent_my_37_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">劳动二重性理论是理解马克思主义政治经济学的枢纽。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"53.431\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"51.441\" id=\"sent_my_37_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场核心陷阱。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"59.222\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"53.431\" id=\"sent_my_37_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">具体劳动生产使用价值，但具体劳动并不是使用价值的唯一源泉。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"62.168\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"59.222\" id=\"sent_my_37_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">自然物质也是使用价值的源泉。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"65.267\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"62.168\" id=\"sent_my_37_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">抽象劳动则是价值的唯一源泉。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_37\" data-end=\"71.939\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_37_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"65.268\" id=\"sent_my_37_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">具体劳动造用值，抽象劳动聚价值，同一过程双重面，政经枢纽启真知。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
