            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/my_38.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_05_my_38\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 03</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">商品价值量的确定、简单劳动与复杂劳动、劳动生产率与价值量的关系</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_05\" id=\"audio_btn_my_38\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"2.819\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_38_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">商品的价值量是由什么决定的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"4.681\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"2.819\" id=\"sent_my_38_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">又是怎样变化的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"9.324\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"4.681\" id=\"sent_my_38_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">商品的价值量是由生产商品所耗费的劳动时间决定的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"15.599\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"9.324\" id=\"sent_my_38_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">但不同生产者的技术熟练程度不同，个别劳动时间无法成为衡量标准。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"19.451\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"15.599\" id=\"sent_my_38_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">决定商品价值量的是社会必要劳动时间。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"24.464\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"19.452\" id=\"sent_my_38_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会必要劳动时间是指在现有的社会正常的生产条件下。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"31.671\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"24.464\" id=\"sent_my_38_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在社会平均的劳动熟练程度和劳动强度下制造某种使用价值所需要的劳动时间。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"36.454\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"31.671\" id=\"sent_my_38_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">劳动生产率是指劳动者生产某种商品的能力或效率。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"43.737\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"36.454\" id=\"sent_my_38_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">商品的价值量与体现在商品中的劳动量成正比，与生产该商品的劳动生产率成反比。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"48.877\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"43.737\" id=\"sent_my_38_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">如果部门劳动生产率提高，单位时间内生产的产品数量增加。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"54.974\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"48.878\" id=\"sent_my_38_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">但生产单位商品的社会必要劳动时间缩短，因而单位商品的价值量降低。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"57.219\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"54.974\" id=\"sent_my_38_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场经典计算题眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"64.451\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"57.219\" id=\"sent_my_38_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">无论部门劳动生产率怎样提高，同一社会必要劳动时间内创造的价值总额保持不变。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_38\" data-end=\"71.238\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_38_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"64.452\" id=\"sent_my_38_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会必要定价值，成正反比两分明，生产率跃单位降，总量衡定守真恒。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
