            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/my_39.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_05_my_39\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 04</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">价值规律的内容、表现形式、主要作用及其自发调节的消极后果</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_05\" id=\"audio_btn_my_39\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"4.362\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_39_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">商品经济运行的普遍客观规律，就是价值规律。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"7.436\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"4.362\" id=\"sent_my_39_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">价值规律的基本内容包括两点。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"12.513\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"7.436\" id=\"sent_my_39_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，商品的价值量由生产商品的社会必要劳动时间决定。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"17.283\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"12.513\" id=\"sent_my_39_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，商品交换以价值量为基础，实行等价交换。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"20.0\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"17.283\" id=\"sent_my_39_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">价值规律的表现形式是什么。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"22.985\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"20.0\" id=\"sent_my_39_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">价格围绕价值自发上下波动。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"30.599\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"22.985\" id=\"sent_my_39_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">因为供求关系会影响价格，供不应求时价格高于价值，供过于求时价格低于价值。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"36.875\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"30.599\" id=\"sent_my_39_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">但从长期和全社会来看，价格的上涨部分和下跌部分会相互抵消。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"39.49\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"36.875\" id=\"sent_my_39_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">价格总额等于价值总额。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"43.648\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"39.49\" id=\"sent_my_39_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">价值规律在商品经济中具有三大积极作用。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"49.77\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"43.648\" id=\"sent_my_39_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">配置社会资源，促进技术进步与提高生产率，调节社会收入分配。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"56.224\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"49.77\" id=\"sent_my_39_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">同时，自发运行也会带来分化，资源浪费和市场失灵等消极后果。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"58.367\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"56.224\" id=\"sent_my_39_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场选择题辨析。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"62.933\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"58.367\" id=\"sent_my_39_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">价格背离价值上下波动绝不是对价值规律的否定。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"67.015\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"62.934\" id=\"sent_my_39_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">反而恰恰是价值规律发生作用的唯一实现形式。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_39\" data-end=\"73.852\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_39_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"67.015\" id=\"sent_my_39_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">等价交换是基准，供求波动显神功，长远总和终相抵，自发双刃见真容。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
