            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/my_41.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_06_my_41\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 02</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">剩余价值的生产过程：不变资本与可变资本的划分及其意义</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_06\" id=\"audio_btn_my_41\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"5.115\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_41_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">资本家购买了生产资料和劳动力，进入资本主义生产过程。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"7.309\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"5.115\" id=\"sent_my_41_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这个过程具有二重性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"14.362\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"7.309\" id=\"sent_my_41_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">一方面是生产使用价值的劳动过程，另一方面是生产剩余价值的价值增殖过程。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"17.997\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"14.362\" id=\"sent_my_41_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">价值增殖过程是资本主义生产的本质。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"20.969\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"17.997\" id=\"sent_my_41_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">工人的劳动时间分为两部分。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"25.574\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"20.969\" id=\"sent_my_41_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一部分是必要劳动时间，用于再生产劳动力的价值。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"30.88\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"25.574\" id=\"sent_my_41_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二部分是剩余劳动时间，无偿为资本家生产剩余价值。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"37.717\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"30.88\" id=\"sent_my_41_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">根据在剩余价值生产中所起作用的不同，资本被划分为不变资本和可变资本。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"44.847\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"37.717\" id=\"sent_my_41_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">不变资本以生产资料形态存在，在生产中只转移自身价值，不改变价值量。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"46.952\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"44.847\" id=\"sent_my_41_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">用字母小写西表示。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"53.099\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"46.952\" id=\"sent_my_41_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">可变资本以劳动力形态存在，在生产中不仅再生产出劳动力价值。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"57.18\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"53.099\" id=\"sent_my_41_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">而且创造了剩余价值，用字母小写微表示。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"64.222\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"57.181\" id=\"sent_my_41_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">不变资本与可变资本的划分，深刻揭示了剩余价值的真正源泉只有可变资本。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"67.003\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"64.222\" id=\"sent_my_41_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">也就是雇佣工人的剩余劳动。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"68.508\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"67.003\" id=\"sent_my_41_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场计算。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"74.962\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"68.508\" id=\"sent_my_41_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">剩余价值率等于小写爱慕除以小写微，反映资本家对工人的剥削程度。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_41\" data-end=\"81.518\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_41_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"74.962\" id=\"sent_my_41_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">增殖过程露本质，必要生产劳力值，不变转移可变创，剥削程度算法实。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
