            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_my_08_my_47\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 01</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">社会主义从空想到科学、从理论到现实的历史发展与中国特色社会主义实践</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_my_08\" id=\"audio_btn_my_47\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"7.309\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_my_47_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">面对资本主义的内在危机，人类追求解放的理想经历了科学社会主义的伟大飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"10.510\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"7.309\" id=\"sent_my_47_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会主义实现了三大历史性飞跃。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"13.405\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"10.51\" id=\"sent_my_47_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，从空想到科学的飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"20.497\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"13.406\" id=\"sent_my_47_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">空想社会主义揭露了资本主义的弊端，但找不到社会变革的阶级力量与现实道路。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"25.038\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"20.497\" id=\"sent_my_47_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">马克思恩格斯创立了唯物史观和剩余价值学说。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"28.648\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"25.038\" id=\"sent_my_47_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">把社会主义置于现实科学的基础之上。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"31.505\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"28.648\" id=\"sent_my_47_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，从理论到现实的飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"38.201\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"31.505\" id=\"sent_my_47_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">列宁领导十月社会主义革命取得伟大胜利，建立了世界上第一个社会主义国家。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"40.867\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"38.202\" id=\"sent_my_47_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">开启了人类历史的新纪元。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"44.655\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"40.867\" id=\"sent_my_47_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，从一国实践到多国发展的飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"49.273\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"44.656\" id=\"sent_my_47_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">二战后社会主义跨越欧亚大陆，在经历曲折之后。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"52.691\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"49.273\" id=\"sent_my_47_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中国特色社会主义迎来了蓬勃生机。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"58.915\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"52.691\" id=\"sent_my_47_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会主义建设具有艰巨性和长期性，社会主义发展模式具有多样性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"64.056\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"58.916\" id=\"sent_my_47_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">必须把科学社会主义基本原则同各国具体实际相结合。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"my_47\" data-end=\"71.224\" data-sent-id=\"sent_my_47_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"64.056\" id=\"sent_my_47_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">空想批判少阶级，两大学说立科学，十月惊雷开现实，中国道路展磅礴。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
