            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_mzt_01_mzt_04\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 02</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">毛泽东思想的科学涵义与活的灵魂（实事求是、群众路线、独立自主）</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_mzt_01\" id=\"audio_btn_mzt_04\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"4.643\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">理解毛泽东思想，最关键的是把握其活的灵魂。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"11.849\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"4.643\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">毛泽东思想活的灵魂有三个基本方面，这就是实事求是，群众路线，独立自主。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"18.099\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"11.849\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这三者贯穿于毛泽东思想的全部内容，是我们党克敌制胜的强大法宝。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"23.01\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"18.099\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，实事求是是毛泽东思想的精髓和根本出发点。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"29.592\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"23.01\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">实事就是客观存在着的一切事物，是就是客观事物的内部联系即规律性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"31.62\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"29.592\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">求就是我们去研究。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"36.684\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"31.62\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">坚持实事求是，就是一切从实际出发，理论联系实际。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"41.327\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"36.684\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">把马克思主义普遍原理同中国具体实际结合起来。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"45.753\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"41.327\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，群众路线是党的根本工作路线和生命线。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"51.837\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"45.753\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这就是一切为了群众，一切依靠群众，从群众中来，到群众中去。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"57.742\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"51.837\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">群众路线的核心在于把人民群众看作历史的主人和力量源泉。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"63.074\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"57.742\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，独立自主是立党立国的重要原则和根本立足点。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"68.992\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"63.074\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中国的事情必须由中国人民自己作主，依靠中国人民自己的力量来办。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"72.806\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"68.992\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">任何外援都必须放在自力更生的基点上。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"74.375\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"72.806\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场避坑。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"80.357\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"74.375\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">精髓是实事求是，生命线是群众路线，根本立足点是独立自主。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"82.653\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"80.357\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">三者定位绝不可颠倒。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_04\" data-end=\"89.758\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_04_17\" data-sent-idx=\"17\" data-start=\"82.653\" id=\"sent_mzt_04_17\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">实事求是铸精髓，群众路线系民心，独立自主立天地，法宝长青耀古今。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
