            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/mzt_12.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_mzt_03_mzt_12\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 03</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">社会主义基本制度在中国的确立及其重大历史意义</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_mzt_03\" id=\"audio_btn_mzt_12\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"3.788\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">1956年底，我国三大改造基本完成。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"11.518\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"3.788\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这标志着社会主义基本制度在中国的确立，是中国历史上最深刻最伟大的社会变革。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"15.791\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"11.518\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会主义基本制度的确立具有重大的历史意义。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"22.079\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"15.791\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，极大地解放和发展了我国的社会生产力，为我国逐步建立起独立的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"27.13\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"22.079\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">比较完整的工业体系和国民经济体系奠定了制度基础。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"32.564\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"27.13\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，使占世界人口四分之一的东方大国跨入了社会主义社会。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"36.518\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"32.564\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这是世界社会主义发展史上的重大历史飞跃。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"40.242\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"36.518\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，极大地改变了世界政治力量的对比。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"44.898\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"40.242\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">有力地鼓舞了被压迫民族和被压迫人民的解放斗争。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"50.969\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"44.898\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第四，是马克思列宁主义同中国实际相结合的又一次伟大飞跃。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"56.824\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"50.969\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">为当代中国的一切发展进步奠定了根本政治前提和制度基础。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"59.094\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"56.824\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场大题核心论断。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"63.622\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"59.094\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中国确立社会主义制度，绝不是违背历史发展规律。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"67.601\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"63.622\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">而是近代以来中国人民的必然历史选择。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"72.36\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"67.602\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">它为中华民族实现伟大复兴提供了坚实的制度保障。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_12\" data-end=\"79.044\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_12_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"72.36\" id=\"sent_mzt_12_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">三大改造功底定，公有制度立神州，独立工业开新局，根本前提万古秋。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
