            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/mzt_14.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_mzt_04_mzt_14\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 02</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">《关于正确处理人民内部矛盾的问题》两类矛盾学说与中国工业化道路</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_mzt_04\" id=\"audio_btn_mzt_14\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"5.179\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">1957年毛泽东发表《关于正确处理人民内部矛盾的问题》。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"8.202\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"5.179\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">创立了社会主义两类矛盾学说。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"13.227\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"8.202\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在社会主义社会确立后，我国国内的主要矛盾发生了转变。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"18.571\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"13.227\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">党的八大指出，主要矛盾是人民对于经济文化迅速发展的。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"23.456\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"18.571\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">需要同当前经济文化不能满足人民需要的状况之间的矛盾。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"29.388\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"23.457\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">毛泽东深刻指出，社会主义社会存在两类性质完全不同的矛盾。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"35.306\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"29.388\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一类是敌我矛盾，是对抗性的矛盾，必须采用专政的方法来解决。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"41.543\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"35.306\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二类是人民内部矛盾，是非对抗性的矛盾，必须采用民主的方法来解决。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"47.028\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"41.543\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">毛泽东强调，正确处理人民内部矛盾是国家政治生活的主题。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"52.385\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"47.028\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">解决人民内部矛盾的科学总方针是团结，批评，团结。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"59.949\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"52.385\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在政治上实行团结，批评，团结，在党派关系上实行长期共存，互相监督。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"67.385\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"59.949\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在科学文化上实行百花齐放，百家争鸣，在经济上实行统筹兼顾，适当安排。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"69.502\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"67.385\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场选择题陷阱。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"76.582\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"69.503\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">两类矛盾的性质不同，但敌我矛盾与人民内部矛盾在一定条件下可以相互转化。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"80.485\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"76.582\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">正确处理人民内部矛盾是政治生活的主题。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_14\" data-end=\"87.181\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_14_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"80.485\" id=\"sent_mzt_14_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">两类矛盾性质殊，敌我专政内部和，百花齐放民主道，团结批评聚力多。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
