            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/mzt_21.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_mzt_07_mzt_21\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 01</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">“三个代表”重要思想的核心观点、历史地位与指导意义</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_mzt_07\" id=\"audio_btn_mzt_21\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"6.696\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">面对世纪之交国内外的复杂形势，中国共产党创立了三个代表重要思想。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"13.597\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"6.696\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">江泽民同志指出，中国共产党必须始终代表中国先进生产力的发展要求。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"19.515\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"13.597\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">代表中国先进文化的前进方向，代表中国最广大人民的根本利益。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"23.762\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"19.515\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">三个代表重要思想的核心观点体现在四个维度。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"30.23\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"23.763\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">发展是党执政兴国的第一要务，必须紧紧扭住经济建设这个中心不动摇。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"35.166\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"30.23\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">建立健全社会主义市场经济体制，确立公有制为主体。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"39.286\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"35.166\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">多种所有制经济共同发展的基本经济制度。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"45.625\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"39.286\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">全面推进党的建设新的伟大工程，始终保持党的先进性和纯洁性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"51.543\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"45.625\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">实行依法治国与以德治国相结合，推进社会主义民主法治建设。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"54.196\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"51.543\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">三个代表是统一的整体。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"61.875\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"54.196\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">先进生产力是物质基础，先进文化是精神动力，最广大人民根本利益是最终归宿。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"64.018\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"61.875\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场选择题经典。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"70.995\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"64.018\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">发展是执政兴国的第一要务，执政为民是贯彻三个代表重要思想的本质要求。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_21\" data-end=\"77.972\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_21_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"70.995\" id=\"sent_mzt_21_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">先进生产铸基础，先进文化引航行，执政为民求福祉，第一要务促繁荣。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
