            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/mzt_22.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_mzt_07_mzt_22\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 02</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">科学发展观的科学内涵（第一要义、核心立场、基本要求、根本方法）与历史地位</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_mzt_07\" id=\"audio_btn_mzt_22\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"4.974\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">进入新世纪新阶段，中国共产党提出了科学发展观。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"11.53\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"4.974\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">胡锦涛同志指出，科学发展观的第一要义是发展，核心立场是以人为本。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"16.900\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"11.531\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">基本要求是全面协调可持续，根本方法是统筹兼顾。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"21.403\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"16.9\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这四句话构成了科学发展观的严密科学内涵。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"27.691\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"21.403\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，第一要义是发展，发展是硬道理，必须坚持以经济建设为中心。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"29.604\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"27.691\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">实现科学发展。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"34.12\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"29.605\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，核心立场是以人为本，把实现好，维护好。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"39.579\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"34.12\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">发展好最广大人民根本利益作为一切工作的出发点和落脚点。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"46.288\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"39.579\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，基本要求是全面协调可持续，全面推进经济，政治，文化。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"52.296\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"46.288\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会和生态文明建设，实现经济发展与人口资源环境相协调。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"59.566\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"52.296\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第四，根本方法是统筹兼顾，统筹城乡发展，区域发展，经济社会发展。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"63.762\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"59.566\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">人与自然和谐发展，国内发展和对外开放。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"70.625\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"63.763\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">科学发展观深刻回答了新形势下实现什么样的发展，怎样发展的重大问题。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"74.77\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"70.625\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">是中国特色社会主义理论体系的重要组成部分。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"76.224\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"74.77\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场题眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"83.214\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"76.224\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一要义，核心立场，基本要求，根本方法，四者定位严格对应，不可张冠李戴。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"mzt_22\" data-end=\"90.14\" data-sent-id=\"sent_mzt_22_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"83.214\" id=\"sent_mzt_22_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">发展第一守要义，以人为本显关怀，统筹兼顾全盘下，协调永续向未来。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
