            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/xsx_07.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_xsx_10_xsx_07\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 01</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">在发展中保障和改善民生与扎实推进全体人民共同富裕</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_xsx_10\" id=\"audio_btn_xsx_07\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"3.559\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">增进民生福祉是发展的根本目的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"10.229\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"3.559\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在发展中保障和改善民生，必须紧扣全体人民共同富裕这一重大课题。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"16.607\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"10.229\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">共同富裕是中国特色社会主义的本质要求，也是中国式现代化的重要特征。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"19.681\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"16.607\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">怎样科学把握共同富裕的内涵。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"24.732\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"19.681\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，共同富裕是全体人民共同富裕，不是少数人的富裕。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"27.423\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"24.732\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">也不是整齐划一的平均主义。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"34.005\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"27.423\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，共同富裕是物质生活和精神生活双富裕，既要富口袋，也要富脑袋。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"40.357\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"34.005\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，共同富裕是一个长期的历史过程，具有阶段性与循序渐进性。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"42.309\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"40.357\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">需要分阶段促进。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"48.393\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"42.309\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">扎实推进共同富裕，必须坚持在高质量发展中促进共同富裕。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"53.457\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"48.393\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">正确处理效率和公平的关系，构建初次分配，再分配。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"56.747\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"53.457\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三次分配协调配套的制度体系。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"62.857\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"56.747\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">加大税收，社保，转移支付等调节力度，扩大中等收入群体比重。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"67.819\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"62.857\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">增加低收入者收入，合理调节高收入，取缔非法收入。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"70.089\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"67.819\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场大题核心题眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"77.193\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"70.089\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">共同富裕绝不是均贫富和平均主义，必须做大蛋糕与分好蛋糕辩证统一。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"xsx_07\" data-end=\"84.005\" data-sent-id=\"sent_xsx_07_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"77.194\" id=\"sent_xsx_07_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">民生福祉守初心，共同富裕步步深，物质精神双丰硕，公平分配暖民心。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
