            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/sg_18.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_sg_07_sg_18\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 03</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">三大战役、中共七届二中全会与“两个务必”</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_sg_07\" id=\"audio_btn_sg_18\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"5.000\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_sg_18_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">1948年秋到1949年初，战略决战的时机成熟。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"11.097\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"5.0\" id=\"sent_sg_18_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">人民解放军连续发动了辽沈战役，淮海战役，平津战役三大战役。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"16.709\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"11.097\" id=\"sent_sg_18_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">三大战役基本消灭了国民党赖以维持反动统治的主要军事力量。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"19.566\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"16.709\" id=\"sent_sg_18_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在全国胜利即将来临的前夜。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"25.127\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"19.566\" id=\"sent_sg_18_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">1949年3月党中央在西柏坡召开了中共七届二中全会。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"29.145\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"25.128\" id=\"sent_sg_18_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">七届二中全会绘制了新中国的宏伟蓝图。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"33.29\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"29.145\" id=\"sent_sg_18_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">确立了党的工作重心由乡村转移到城市。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"38.253\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"33.291\" id=\"sent_sg_18_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">阐明了新中国的经济构成和向社会主义转变的前途。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"45.995\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"38.253\" id=\"sent_sg_18_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">毛泽东在会上语重心长地告诫全党，务必使同志们继续地保持谦虚，谨慎，不骄。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"47.551\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"45.995\" id=\"sent_sg_18_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">不躁的作风。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"53.342\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"47.551\" id=\"sent_sg_18_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">务必使同志们继续地保持艰苦奋斗的作风，这就是著名的两个务必。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"58.903\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"53.342\" id=\"sent_sg_18_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">党中央从西柏坡进京赶考，开启了建设新中国的伟大征程。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"61.173\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"58.903\" id=\"sent_sg_18_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场大题核心题眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"68.711\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"61.173\" id=\"sent_sg_18_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">七届二中全会实现工作重心由农村向城市转移，提出两个务必以防糖衣炮弹。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_18\" data-end=\"75.408\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_18_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"68.712\" id=\"sent_sg_18_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">三大战役摧枯拉，西柏坡前绘制宏，两个务必防蜕变，进京赶考铸丰功。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
