            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/sg_20.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_sg_08_sg_20\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 01</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">抗美援朝、过渡时期总路线与社会主义制度确立</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_sg_08\" id=\"audio_btn_sg_20\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"6.199\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_sg_20_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">新中国诞生后，面对帝国主义的武装威胁，党毅然作出了抗美援朝。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"8.546\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"6.199\" id=\"sent_sg_20_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">保家卫国的英明决策。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"15.689\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"8.546\" id=\"sent_sg_20_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中国人民志愿军跨过鸭绿江，同朝鲜军民并肩作战，打败了不可一世的侵略者。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"22.385\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"15.689\" id=\"sent_sg_20_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">抗美援朝战争的胜利，打破了美帝国主义不可战胜的神话，顶住了侵略扩张。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"27.104\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"22.385\" id=\"sent_sg_20_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">保卫了新中国安全，极大地提高了新中国的国际威望。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"34.171\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"27.105\" id=\"sent_sg_20_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在巩固政权的同时，党提出了过渡时期总路线，展开了有计划的社会主义经济建设。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"39.885\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"34.171\" id=\"sent_sg_20_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">实施了第一个五年计划，一大批现代工业骨干项目相继建成。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"46.02\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"39.885\" id=\"sent_sg_20_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">伴随着对农业，手工业和资本主义工商业社会主义改造的胜利完成。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"52.066\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"46.02\" id=\"sent_sg_20_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">1954年第一届全国人民代表大会通过了第一部《中华人民共和国宪法》。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"54.324\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"52.066\" id=\"sent_sg_20_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">确立了根本政治制度。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"57.538\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"54.324\" id=\"sent_sg_20_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">1956年社会主义改造完成。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"63.673\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"57.538\" id=\"sent_sg_20_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">标志着社会主义基本制度在我国确立，中国进入了社会主义初级阶段。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"65.943\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"63.673\" id=\"sent_sg_20_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场大题核心题眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"71.518\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"65.944\" id=\"sent_sg_20_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">抗美援朝是立国之战，一届人大确立人民代表大会根本制度。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"74.566\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"71.518\" id=\"sent_sg_20_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">三大改造完成进入初级阶段。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sg_20\" data-end=\"81.326\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sg_20_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"74.566\" id=\"sent_sg_20_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">抗美援朝立国威，一五计划工业基，首部宪法保民主，初级阶段展宏图。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
