            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/sx_04.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_sx_01_sx_04\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 03</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">辩证对待人生矛盾与坚决批判错误人生观</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_sx_01\" id=\"audio_btn_sx_04\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"6.926\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_sx_04_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在漫长的人生道路上，每个人都会遇到顺境与逆境，得与失，生与死的矛盾。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"11.365\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"6.926\" id=\"sent_sx_04_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">辩证对待人生矛盾，是人生观修养的重要课题。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"13.457\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"11.365\" id=\"sent_sx_04_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">对待顺境与逆境。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"18.482\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"13.457\" id=\"sent_sx_04_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">顺境为发展提供了顺畅的条件，但容易让人滋生骄傲。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"22.423\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"18.482\" id=\"sent_sx_04_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">逆境增加了阻力和磨难，但能磨砺人的意志。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"28.176\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"22.423\" id=\"sent_sx_04_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">顺境与逆境在一定条件下可以相互转化，关键在于主观努力。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"29.911\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"28.176\" id=\"sent_sx_04_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">对待得与失。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"36.135\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"29.911\" id=\"sent_sx_04_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">不能把一时的得失看得太重，要树立吃亏是福，不计名利的豁达胸襟。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"37.755\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"36.135\" id=\"sent_sx_04_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">对待苦与乐。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"43.546\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"37.755\" id=\"sent_sx_04_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">苦乐相伴，为了崇高理想而艰苦奋斗，苦中有乐，以苦为荣。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"48.941\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"43.546\" id=\"sent_sx_04_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">同时，必须坚决批判资产阶级和剥削阶级的错误人生观。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"54.158\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"48.941\" id=\"sent_sx_04_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">坚决批判拜金主义，金钱不是衡量人生价值的唯一标准。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"59.311\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"54.158\" id=\"sent_sx_04_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">坚决批判享乐主义，沉溺感官享乐会导致精神堕落。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"66.696\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"59.311\" id=\"sent_sx_04_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">坚决批判极端个人主义，把个人利益凌驾于集体和人民利益之上必然危害社会。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"68.15\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"66.696\" id=\"sent_sx_04_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场题眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"74.541\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"68.151\" id=\"sent_sx_04_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">顺逆互变看作为，三大错误人生观本质上都是剥削阶级意识形态的反映。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_04\" data-end=\"81.76\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_04_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"74.541\" id=\"sent_sx_04_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">顺逆互转砺坚贞，得失从容见赤心，拜金享乐当扫净，崇高人格立古今。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
