            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/sx_06.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_sx_02_sx_06\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 02</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">坚定马克思主义信仰与中国特色社会主义共同理想</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_sx_02\" id=\"audio_btn_sx_06\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"5.089\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_sx_06_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在新时代，中国青年应当确立怎样的科学理想信念。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"10.74\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"5.089\" id=\"sent_sx_06_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这就是坚定马克思主义信仰，坚定中国特色社会主义共同理想。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"14.158\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"10.74\" id=\"sent_sx_06_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">为什么马克思主义值得我们终生信仰？</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"19.694\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"14.158\" id=\"sent_sx_06_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，马克思主义是极其崇高的科学真理，如实反映了自然。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"22.258\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"19.694\" id=\"sent_sx_06_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会和思维的发展规律。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"27.908\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"22.258\" id=\"sent_sx_06_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，马克思主义具有持久的生命力，具有与时俱进的理论品格。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"34.222\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"27.908\" id=\"sent_sx_06_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，马克思主义以实现人类解放为己任，体现了最崇高的人民立场。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"40.0\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"34.222\" id=\"sent_sx_06_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中国特色社会主义是科学社会主义在当代中国的成功实践。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"43.406\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"40.0\" id=\"sent_sx_06_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">坚定中特信念，必须树立四个自信。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"47.857\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"43.406\" id=\"sent_sx_06_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">道路自信，理论自信，制度自信，文化自信。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"55.574\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"47.857\" id=\"sent_sx_06_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">文化自信是更基础，更广泛，更深厚的自信，是一个国家，一个民族发展中最基本。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"58.278\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"55.574\" id=\"sent_sx_06_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">最深沉，最持久的力量。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"59.847\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"58.278\" id=\"sent_sx_06_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场避坑。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"67.13\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"59.847\" id=\"sent_sx_06_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">文化自信是更基础，更广泛，更深厚的自信，四个自信的层级关系不可错位。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_06\" data-end=\"73.992\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_06_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"67.13\" id=\"sent_sx_06_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">科学真理指航路，人民立场见崇高，中特信念四自信，文化底蕴最深厚。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
