            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/sx_07.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_sx_02_sx_07\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 03</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">理想与现实的辩证统一及在实践中化理想为现实</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_sx_02\" id=\"audio_btn_sx_07\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"4.770\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_sx_07_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">确立了理想，怎样把崇高的理想变为现实的成果。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"9.145\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"4.77\" id=\"sent_sx_07_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">这就需要正确把握理想与现实的辩证统一关系。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"11.9\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"9.145\" id=\"sent_sx_07_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">理想与现实是对立统一的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"13.469\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"11.901\" id=\"sent_sx_07_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">对立表现在。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"20.382\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"13.469\" id=\"sent_sx_07_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">理想是完美的，未来的，现实是存在缺陷的，当下的，两者存在着差距。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"22.015\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"20.383\" id=\"sent_sx_07_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">统一表现在。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"25.497\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"22.015\" id=\"sent_sx_07_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">现实中孕育着理想，是理想的基础。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"29.821\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"25.497\" id=\"sent_sx_07_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">理想源于现实，又高于现实，是现实的升华。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"34.974\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"29.821\" id=\"sent_sx_07_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">把理想转化为现实的唯一桥梁是艰苦奋斗的社会实践。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"37.703\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"34.974\" id=\"sent_sx_07_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">坚决反对两种片面倾向。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"43.814\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"37.704\" id=\"sent_sx_07_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">一种是以现实否定理想，看到现实的困难就灰心丧气，放弃理想。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"46.097\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"43.814\" id=\"sent_sx_07_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">滑向庸俗现实主义。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"52.819\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"46.097\" id=\"sent_sx_07_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">另一种是以理想否定现实，沉溺于空想幻想，稍遇挫折就怨天尤人。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"55.217\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"52.819\" id=\"sent_sx_07_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">滑向唯心空想主义。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"57.321\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"55.217\" id=\"sent_sx_07_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">幸福是奋斗出来的。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"64.783\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_15\" data-sent-idx=\"15\" data-start=\"57.321\" id=\"sent_sx_07_15\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">唯有立足现实，勇挑重担，在实干中迎难而上，才能一步步将蓝图化为现实。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"67.053\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_16\" data-sent-idx=\"16\" data-start=\"64.783\" id=\"sent_sx_07_16\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场大题核心题眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"73.099\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_17\" data-sent-idx=\"17\" data-start=\"67.054\" id=\"sent_sx_07_17\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">实践是理想转化为现实的唯一桥梁，奋斗是实现理想的根本途径。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_07\" data-end=\"79.923\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_07_18\" data-sent-idx=\"18\" data-start=\"73.099\" id=\"sent_sx_07_18\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">现实孕育理想苗，理想指引现实跑，唯有实践通天堑，艰苦奋斗步步高。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
