            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/sx_08.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_sx_03_sx_08\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 01</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">中国精神的科学内涵与弘扬新时代爱国主义</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_sx_03\" id=\"audio_btn_sx_08\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"3.839\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_sx_08_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中国精神是兴国之魂，强国之魂。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"11.632\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"3.839\" id=\"sent_sx_08_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中国精神包含以爱国主义为核心的民族精神，和以改革创新为核心的时代精神。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"14.133\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"11.633\" id=\"sent_sx_08_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">伟大的民族精神熔铸为。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"20.51\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"14.133\" id=\"sent_sx_08_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">伟大创造精神，伟大奋斗精神，伟大团结精神，伟大梦想精神。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"28.52\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"20.51\" id=\"sent_sx_08_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">爱国主义是中华民族的优良传统，是动员和鼓舞中国人民团结奋斗的一面光辉旗帜。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"31.377\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"28.52\" id=\"sent_sx_08_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">新时代爱国主义的鲜明内涵。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"38.393\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"31.378\" id=\"sent_sx_08_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，爱国主义是历史的，具体的，在不同的历史时期具有不同的时代要求。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"43.852\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"38.393\" id=\"sent_sx_08_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，爱国主义与爱社会主义具有内在一致性，当代中国。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"49.49\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"43.852\" id=\"sent_sx_08_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">爱国主义的本质就是坚持爱国和爱党，爱社会主义高度统一。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"56.837\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"49.49\" id=\"sent_sx_08_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，爱国主义要求维护祖国统一和民族团结，这是各族人民的根本利益所在。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"64.107\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"56.837\" id=\"sent_sx_08_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第四，爱国主义必须立足民族，面向世界，具有宽广的国际视野和人类胸怀。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"66.237\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"64.107\" id=\"sent_sx_08_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场大题必背原话。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"72.895\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"66.237\" id=\"sent_sx_08_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">当代中国爱国主义的本质就是坚持爱国，爱党，爱社会主义高度统一。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_08\" data-end=\"79.821\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_08_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"72.895\" id=\"sent_sx_08_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">爱国时代融一体，民族精神贯长虹，改革创新催奋进，爱党爱国同一宗。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
