            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/sx_10.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_sx_05_sx_10\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 01</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">社会主义道德的核心与集体主义原则的层次结构</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_sx_05\" id=\"audio_btn_sx_10\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"5.230\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_sx_10_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">在社会精神文明建设中，道德起着重要的规范和指引作用。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"8.852\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"5.23\" id=\"sent_sx_10_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">道德是反映经济基础，依靠社会舆论。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"14.311\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"8.852\" id=\"sent_sx_10_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">传统习俗和内心信念维系的社会意识形态和行为规范。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"17.882\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"14.311\" id=\"sent_sx_10_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会主义道德建设的核心是为人民服务。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"20.74\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"17.883\" id=\"sent_sx_10_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">为什么必须以为人民服务为核心？</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"25.128\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"20.74\" id=\"sent_sx_10_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">因为为人民服务是社会主义经济基础的客观要求。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"30.115\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"25.128\" id=\"sent_sx_10_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">是社会主义道德区别于以往剥削阶级道德的根本标志。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"33.469\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"30.115\" id=\"sent_sx_10_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会主义道德的原则是集体主义。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"37.347\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"33.469\" id=\"sent_sx_10_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">集体主义原则包含三个层次的道德要求。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"44.056\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"37.347\" id=\"sent_sx_10_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">最高层次是无私奉献，一心为公，这是共产党员和先进分子的道德追求。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"49.898\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"44.056\" id=\"sent_sx_10_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中间层次是先公后私，公私兼顾，这是对全体公民的普遍要求。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"56.148\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"49.898\" id=\"sent_sx_10_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">基本层次是遵纪守法，不损公肥私，这是道德与法律的底线要求。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"58.495\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"56.148\" id=\"sent_sx_10_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场大题核心考眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"63.724\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"58.495\" id=\"sent_sx_10_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会主义道德建设的核心是为人民服务，原则是集体主义。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_10\" data-end=\"70.178\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_10_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"63.724\" id=\"sent_sx_10_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">经济基础映品德，服务人民铸内核，集体主义三层次，公私兼顾正气阔。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
