            "audio": "audio_cards/pol/sx_11.mp3",
            "lectureHtml": "<div class=\"card-audio-stream-pane\" id=\"stream_pane_ch_sx_05_sx_11\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-audio-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"sub-card-title-row\">\n<span class=\"sub-card-badge\">音轨 02</span>\n<h4 class=\"sub-card-title\">中华传统美德的创造性转化与“四德”建设体系</h4>\n<button class=\"card-audio-btn\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-chapter-id=\"ch_sx_05\" id=\"audio_btn_sx_11\" type=\"button\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs audio-play-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"></polygon></svg>\n<span class=\"audio-btn-text\">试听伴读</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lecture-structured-wrap\">\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-golden\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"></path></svg>\n<span>考点设问引入与立论锚点</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-intro-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"6.454\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_0\" data-sent-idx=\"0\" data-start=\"0.1\" id=\"sent_sx_11_0\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">道德建设离不开传统文化的滋养，中华传统美德是中华文化的精髓。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"11.964\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_1\" data-sent-idx=\"1\" data-start=\"6.454\" id=\"sent_sx_11_1\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">对待中华传统美德，必须坚持创造性转化与创新性发展。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"16.339\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_2\" data-sent-idx=\"2\" data-start=\"11.964\" id=\"sent_sx_11_2\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">取其精华，去其糟粕，批判继承，古为今用。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"20.688\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_3\" data-sent-idx=\"3\" data-start=\"16.339\" id=\"sent_sx_11_3\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">社会主义道德建设全面落实为四德建设体系。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-outline\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"3.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n<span>核心概念深度因果推导</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-outline-content\">\n<div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"26.607\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_4\" data-sent-idx=\"4\" data-start=\"20.689\" id=\"sent_sx_11_4\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第一，社会公德，以文明礼貌，助人为乐，爱护公物，保护环境。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"30.255\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_5\" data-sent-idx=\"5\" data-start=\"26.607\" id=\"sent_sx_11_5\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">遵纪守法为主要内容，规范公共生活。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"36.237\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_6\" data-sent-idx=\"6\" data-start=\"30.255\" id=\"sent_sx_11_6\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第二，职业道德，以爱岗敬业，诚实守信，办事公道，热情服务。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"40.752\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_7\" data-sent-idx=\"7\" data-start=\"36.237\" id=\"sent_sx_11_7\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">奉献社会为主要内容，诚实守信是道德基石。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"46.99\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_8\" data-sent-idx=\"8\" data-start=\"40.753\" id=\"sent_sx_11_8\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第三，家庭美德，以尊老爱幼，男女平等，夫妻和睦，勤俭持家。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"49.541\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_9\" data-sent-idx=\"9\" data-start=\"46.99\" id=\"sent_sx_11_9\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">邻里互助为主要内容。</span></div><div class=\"stream-outline-row\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"57.015\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_10\" data-sent-idx=\"10\" data-start=\"49.541\" id=\"sent_sx_11_10\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">第四，个人品德，通过学思并重，省察克治，慎独自律，锤炼高尚品德修养。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"63.265\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_11\" data-sent-idx=\"11\" data-start=\"57.015\" id=\"sent_sx_11_11\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">慎独是在无人监督的情况下依然严守道德底线，是极高的修养境界。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-tips\">\n<div class=\"stream-tip-box xiao\">\n<span class=\"stream-tip-badge xiao\">〔考场避坑 · 审题红线与偷换陷阱〕</span>\n<div class=\"stream-tip-body\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"64.719\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_12\" data-sent-idx=\"12\" data-start=\"63.265\" id=\"sent_sx_11_12\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">考场题眼。</span> <span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"71.849\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_13\" data-sent-idx=\"13\" data-start=\"64.719\" id=\"sent_sx_11_13\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">职业道德的核心是爱岗敬业，基石是诚实守信，慎独是个人品德重要方法。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-card stream-card-lecture\">\n<div class=\"stream-card-label\">\n<svg class=\"ui-svg xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg>\n<span>考点本质闭环与采分口诀</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-box\">\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-tag\">〔秒杀口诀与记忆回路〕</div>\n<div class=\"stream-takeaway-text\"><span class=\"recite-sentence\" data-card-id=\"sx_11\" data-end=\"78.979\" data-sent-id=\"sent_sx_11_14\" data-sent-idx=\"14\" data-start=\"71.849\" id=\"sent_sx_11_14\" title=\"点击从该句起播\">中华美德古今扬，两创精神赋新光，四德筑牢文明路，慎独自律韵流长。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
