          "num": 2,
          "tag": "意识起源",
          "html": "在意识的产生和发展过程中起着决定性作用的是<strong class=\"xt-keyword cloze\" data-cloze=\"社会实践\" data-ghost=\"社·实践\">社会实践</strong>（劳动）。",
          "voice_start": 19.11,
          "voice_end": 27.88,
          "anlang_start": 4.29,
          "anlang_end": 12.37
